## GIT3 — The cost of splitting the graph query on middle vertex and edge conditions, and aggregation absorption
traits: start=narrowed in the middle hops=2 fan-out=medium aggregate Top-20 | R3 middle: c.committed_date | R5 edge: t.insertions | R6 aggregate / sort: au.name, f.path

### GIT3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(au.name, files)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[files DESC, au.name ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: au.name | count(DISTINCT f.path) AS files]
  :       GetProperty(f.path) [node:File]
  :         GetProperty(au.name) [node:Author]
  :           Filter((t.insertions >= 100))
  :             GetProperty(t.insertions) [rel:TOUCHED]
  :               Expand((c)-[t:TOUCHED]->(f:File))
  :                 Expand((c)<-[_r0:AUTHORED]-(au:Author))
  :                   Filter((c.committed_date >= "2024-01-01"))
  :                     GetProperty(c.committed_date) [node:Commit]
  :                       EntityScan(c:Commit)

### GIT3 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[files DESC, au.name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: au.name | count(DISTINCT f.path) AS files]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(f) out=(f, f.path)
        : GetProperty(f.path) [node:File]
        :   Argument(f)
        Fetch[mysql] in=(au) out=(au, au.name)
          : GetProperty(au.name) [node:Author]
          :   Argument(au)
          StoreQuery[mysql] in=(t) out=(t)
            : Filter((t.insertions >= 100))
            :   GetProperty(t.insertions) [rel:TOUCHED]
            :     Argument(t)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, au, f, t)
              : Expand((c)-[t:TOUCHED]->(f:File))
              :   Expand((c)<-[_r0:AUTHORED]-(au:Author))
              :     Argument(c)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(c)
                : Filter((c.committed_date >= "2024-01-01"))
                :   GetProperty(c.committed_date) [node:Commit]
                :     EntityScan(c:Commit)

### GIT3 @document
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[files DESC, au.name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: au.name | count(DISTINCT f.path) AS files]
      Fetch[mongo] in=(f) out=(f, f.path)
        : GetProperty(f.path) [node:File]
        :   Argument(f)
        Fetch[mongo] in=(au) out=(au, au.name)
          : GetProperty(au.name) [node:Author]
          :   Argument(au)
          StoreQuery[mongo] in=(t) out=(t)
            : Filter((t.insertions >= 100))
            :   GetProperty(t.insertions) [rel:TOUCHED]
            :     Argument(t)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, au, f, t)
              : Expand((c)-[t:TOUCHED]->(f:File))
              :   Expand((c)<-[_r0:AUTHORED]-(au:Author))
              :     Argument(c)
              StoreQuery[mongo] out=(c)
                : Filter((c.committed_date >= "2024-01-01"))
                :   GetProperty(c.committed_date) [node:Commit]
                :     EntityScan(c:Commit)

### GIT3 @columnar
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[files DESC, au.name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: au.name | count(DISTINCT f.path) AS files]
      Fetch[clickhouse] in=(f) out=(f, f.path)
        : GetProperty(f.path) [node:File]
        :   Argument(f)
        Fetch[clickhouse] in=(au) out=(au, au.name)
          : GetProperty(au.name) [node:Author]
          :   Argument(au)
          StoreQuery[clickhouse] in=(t) out=(t)
            : Filter((t.insertions >= 100))
            :   GetProperty(t.insertions) [rel:TOUCHED]
            :     Argument(t)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, au, f, t)
              : Expand((c)-[t:TOUCHED]->(f:File))
              :   Expand((c)<-[_r0:AUTHORED]-(au:Author))
              :     Argument(c)
              StoreQuery[clickhouse] out=(c)
                : Filter((c.committed_date >= "2024-01-01"))
                :   GetProperty(c.committed_date) [node:Commit]
                :     EntityScan(c:Commit)

### GIT3 @widecolumn
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[files DESC, au.name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: au.name | count(DISTINCT f.path) AS files]
      Fetch[cassandra] in=(f) out=(f, f.path)
        : GetProperty(f.path) [node:File]
        :   Argument(f)
        Fetch[cassandra] in=(au) out=(au, au.name)
          : GetProperty(au.name) [node:Author]
          :   Argument(au)
